# Your shop

{{if eq .Total 0 -}}
Nobody has ordered anything yet. When they do, this is where it shows up.
{{- else -}}
{{if or .NeedsReply .ToSend .Lapsed -}}
--panel[padding=14, margin=0 0 14 0, border=1, color=accent, radius=8]--
## Waiting on you

{{- /*
Each line goes to the orders it is about.

It said "open the order book" and led to the whole book, unfiltered: a seller
told fifteen orders are waiting was handed every order they have ever taken
and left to find them. The book takes a filter in its path now, so the line
can point at exactly the fifteen. See orderlist.go.
*/}}
{{ if .ToSend }}**[{{ .ToSend }} paid and not sent yet](/admin/orders/paid/newest)**
{{ end }}{{ if .NeedsReply }}**[{{ .NeedsReply }} waiting on a reply from you](/admin/orders/open/newest)**
{{ end }}{{ if .Lapsed }}**[{{ .Lapsed }} unpaid past the time their amount was quoted for](/admin/orders/waiting/oldest)** — they will not pay themselves
{{ end }}
--/panel--
{{ else -}}
--panel[padding=14, margin=0 0 14 0, border=1, color=outline, radius=8]--
Nothing is waiting on you.
--/panel--
{{ end -}}

--panel[padding=14, margin=0 0 14 0, border=1, color=outline, radius=8]--
## The money

Taken: **{{ money .Taken }}** across {{ .Paid }} paid, {{ .Shipped }} sent and {{ .Completed }} completed
{{ if .Pending }}
Waiting to be paid: **{{ money .Pending }}** across {{ .Unpaid }} order{{ if ne .Unpaid 1 }}s{{ end }}
{{ end }}{{ if .Canceled }}
Called off: {{ .Canceled }}
{{ end }}
--/panel--

## The newest orders

{{- /*
The same rows the order book draws, in the same clothes.

They were a plainer copy: no ribbon on the ones waiting, and no way through
to the filtered list. A dashboard that shows orders differently from the page
they live on is a second order book somebody has to learn.
*/}}
{{range .Recent}}
{{if .Wants true -}}
--panel[full=on, padding=12, margin=0 0 8 0, border=2, color=accent, radius=8, badge=Needs you, badgeink=accent]--
{{- else -}}
--panel[full=on, padding=12, margin=0 0 8 0, border=1, color=outline, radius=8]--
{{- end}}
--listing--
title: Order #{{ .ID.Num }} — {{ orderSays .Order }}
link: /admin/order/{{.User}}/{{.ID}}
summary: {{ if .UserNick }}{{ .UserNick }}{{ else }}{{ .User.ShortLogID }}{{ end }} · {{ .PlacedTS.Format "2 Jan 2006, 15:04" }}{{ if .AwaitingSeller }} · waiting on you{{ end }}{{ if .Expired }} · quote lapsed{{ end }}
meta: {{ money .Total }}
button: Open
style: {{ if .Open }}primary{{ else }}plain{{ end }}
--/listing--
--/panel--
{{- end}}

[Open the order book](/admin/orders) — every order, with filters.

